In RAN3#117bis, a CR in R3-225893 proposed a correction of the name used for referencing the IE in the RRC spec (38.331). During the discussion of this CR it was clarified that F1AP is not really consistent in how the IEs in the RRC spec are referenced. The change could be considered editorial but it would be beneficial to define some kind of convention for how we reference IEs in RRC specifications. Hence, the rapporteurs were tasked as follows: The spec rapporteurs to find the consistent principle on referring to RRC IE in our RAN3 specs in R18 before next meeting

